---
title: Standing Glute Stretch
type: docs
prev: docs/rastyazhka/
---
![растяжка большой ягодичной мышцы](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ccf9bece-5297-494d-9d8c-bb5830097b7f)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Stand up straight. Lift your right knee up and hold onto your shin with both hands.

### Step 2
Gently hug your knee up toward your chest using your arms. Make sure to keep your upper body tall—do not lean forward.

### Step 3
Hold this position for 15–20 seconds, then slowly lower your leg back down to the floor.

### Step 4
Complete the desired number of reps, then repeat the stretch with your left knee.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Never pull to the point of sharp pain.

• Try to keep your hip and glute muscles relaxed during the stretch.

• Breathe naturally and easily—do not hold your breath.
{{< /callout >}}
